<title>ITALY: Italy's Interpump to make Bourse debut on Dec 16.</title>
<headline>Italy's Interpump to make Bourse debut on Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian pump and piston company Interpump will make its debut on the Milan stock exchange on Monday, December 16, a Bourse statement said.</p>
<p>The company said this week that its public offering had been oversubscribed with requests for 70.6 million ordinary shares against the 25.8 million offered.</p>
<p>Interpump offered the shares, equal to 32 percent of the company's capital, at 5,800 lire each.</p>
<p>The stock was quoted on the grey market on Thursday at 5,460/5,560 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
